---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Ekansh Vinaik"
  description="Ekansh Vinaik's personal website."
>
  <p>
    I'm a software engineer at <a
      class="tag two-sigma"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="https://www.twosigma.com/">Two Sigma</a
    >. I studied Computer Science at the <a
      class="tag maryland"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="https://www.umd.edu/">University of Maryland, College Park</a
    >.
  </p>
  <p>
    In 2019, I interned at <a
      class="tag two-sigma"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="https://www.twosigmaiq.com/">Two Sigma Insurance Quantified</a
    > and <a
      class="tag facebook"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="https://www.facebook.com/">Facebook</a
    >. Previously, I've had a chance to contribute at <a
      class="tag capital-one"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="https://www.capitalonelabs.com/">Capital One Labs</a
    >, and <a
      class="tag amazon"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="https://aws.amazon.com/">Amazon Web Services</a
    >.
  </p>
  <p>
    At school, I completed research at the <a
      class="tag maryland"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="http://mbrc.umd.edu/">Maryland Blended Reality Center</a
    >. I specialized in virtual and augmented reality, including their medical
    applications and streaming optimizations. I'm also an alumni of the <a
      class="tag quest"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="https://www.rhsmith.umd.edu/programs/undergraduate-programs/academics/fellows-special-programs/quest"
      >QUEST Honors Program</a
    >, a program focusing on design and innovation.
  </p>
  <p>
    Outside of that, I share code on <a
      class="tag github"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="https://github.com/evinaik/">GitHub</a
    >, where you'll find both completed projects and works in progress. For
    example, I've published a multidisciplinary team designing a virtual reality
    memory palace called <a
      class="tag discovr"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="https://github.com/evinaik/discovr">DiscoVR</a
    >. Feel free to connect with me on my <a
      class="tag linkedin"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      href="https://linkedin.com/in/evinaik">LinkedIn</a
    > as well.
  </p>
  <p>
    Interested? Contact me at <a
      class="tag email"
      href="mailto:ekansh.vinaik@gmail.com">ekansh.vinaik@gmail.com</a
    >.
  </p>
  <hr />
</Layout>

<style>
  .tag {
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.15em 0.3em;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: filter 120ms ease-in-out;
  }

  .tag:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.15) opacity(0.85);
  }

  /* Long tags would overflow a narrow viewport if kept on one line. */
  @media (max-width: 400px) {
    .tag {
      white-space: normal;
    }
  }

  .two-sigma {
    background-color: #4398a4;
  }
  .amazon {
    background-color: #f90;
    color: #000;
  }
  .capital-one {
    background-color: #004977;
  }
  .facebook {
    background-color: #3b5998;
  }
  .discovr {
    background-color: #7f1ae5;
  }
  .email {
    background-color: #ea4335;
  }
  .github {
    background-color: #333;
  }
  .linkedin {
    background-color: #0077b5;
  }
  .quest {
    background-color: #5e2b3c;
  }
  .maryland {
    background-color: #e03a3e;
  }
</style>
